    "body": "I think we can simplify the logic here a little:\r\n- Have a variable that determines whether the next printed module needs its prefix\r\n\t- This variable starts as `true` so that we don't print the first module\r\n- If the last module was a `line_break` module, set the variable to `true`\r\n\r\nThis way we can avoid repeating the logic for the first module and the one following `line_break`. It would also allow the prompt to possibly have multiple `line_break` modules. 😄 ",
